    <string name="cues_intro">This \"Madsaz\" application is used to translate (identify) an infant (0-3 months old) cries, to make parents understand their baby better. There are five languages of the DBL version that can be recognized by this application, such as: neh means hunger, owh means tiredness, eh means belch, eairh means bloat, heh means inconvenience (could be due to a wet diaper, too hot or cold air, or anything else)</string>
